// Plan by financial year, Spending Review group and plan source equals the sum of dw.fact_plan on the same keys,
// leaving out the administration rows that are part of resource DEL (no plan measure is chosen here). Every cell is
// at the grain of its plan, so none is blanked by the guard.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group],
    'Plan Source'[Plan Source Code],
    "plan", [Plan]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year], 'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group], 'Plan Source'[Plan Source Code]
